  "description": "The IAB\u202fSpiders\u202f&\u202fRobots enrichment is currently enabled. It is identified as **IAB Spiders & Robots Enrichment** and is supplied by the vendor **com.snowplowanalytics.snowplow.enrichments**.\n\nThe enrichment uses three reference files stored in S3: the user\u2011agent exclusion list resides at `s3://enrichment-configs/exclude_current.txt` (database\u202f=\u202fexclude_current.txt); the user\u2011agent inclusion list is at `s3://enrichment-configs/include_current.txt` (database\u202f=\u202finclude_current.txt); and the IP address exclusion CIDR list is located at `s3://enrichment-configs/ip_exclude_current_cidr.txt` (database\u202f=\u202fip_exclude_current_cidr.txt).",
